<p style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: '굴림'; color: rgb(0,0,0); margin: 0px; letter-spacing: -1px; line-height: 130%; text-indent: 0px"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: '굴림'; color: rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing: -1px; line-height: 17px">-고려(高麗) 12세기</span></p>

<p style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: '굴림'; color: rgb(0,0,0); margin: 0px; letter-spacing: -1px; line-height: 130%; text-indent: 0px"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: '굴림'; color: rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing: -1px; line-height: 17px">-최대지름 11.5, 높이 2.4cm</span></p>

<p style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: '굴림'; color: rgb(0,0,0); margin: 0px; letter-spacing: -1px; line-height: 130%; text-indent: 0px">&nbsp;</p>

