<p style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: '굴림'; color: rgb(0,0,0); margin: 0px; line-height: 130%; text-indent: 0px"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: '굴림'; color: rgb(0,0,0); letter-spacing: 0px; line-height: 17px">고려(高麗) 의종 2년(1148)</span></p>

