<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 굴림">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>- </span><span style="font-family: 굴림">루브르박물관의 개략적인 설명<span lang="EN-US"> <o:p></o:p></span></span></p>

