<p class="0" style="line-height: 32px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: notokr-regular; font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-weight: 600;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">*&nbsp;</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">본 전시는 다음 교체 전시까지 계속 진행합니다</span><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">.</span></span></p> 
<p class="0" style="line-height: 32px; list-style: none; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: notokr-regular; font-size: 16px;"><span style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;"><span style="font-weight: 600;"></span></span></p>$str$,
