<p class="0" style="text-align: left; line-height: 130%; text-indent: -27pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 8pt; margin-left: 36px;"><span style="font-family: HY중고딕; font-size: 8pt;"> </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 8pt;">‧「</span><span style="font-size: 8pt;">독립유공자예우에 관한 법률</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 8pt;">」</span></p> 
