<p class="1" style="line-height: 160%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">7. </span><span style="font-size: 11pt;">강혜정</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">&amp;</span><span style="font-size: 11pt;">정수연 듀엣</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">_ Sull'aria...(</span><span style="font-size: 11pt;">오페라 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">&lsquo;</span><span style="font-size: 11pt;">피가로의 결혼</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">&rsquo; </span><span style="font-size: 11pt;">중</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">) / W. A. Mozart</span></p> 
<p class="1" style="line-height: 160%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">8. </span><span style="font-size: 11pt;">정혜욱</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">&amp;</span><span style="font-size: 11pt;">전준한 듀엣</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">_ La ci darem la mano(</span><span style="font-size: 11pt;">오페라 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">&lsquo;</span><span style="font-size: 11pt;">돈 죠반니</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">&rsquo; </span><span style="font-size: 11pt;">중</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">) / W. A. Mozart</span></p> 
<p class="1" style="line-height: 160%;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">9. </span><span style="font-size: 11pt;">이재욱</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">&amp;</span><span style="font-size: 11pt;">한명원 듀엣</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">_ O Mimi tu piu non torni(</span><span style="font-size: 11pt;">오페라 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">'</span><span style="font-size: 11pt;">라 보엠</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">'</span><span style="font-size: 11pt;">중</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 11pt;">) / G. Puccini</span></p> 
