<p class="0" style="line-height: 115%; margin-left: 36px; text-indent: -27pt; word-break: keep-all;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;">ㅇ 예술인패스</span><span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 돋움;">(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;">한국예술인복지재단 발급</span><span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 돋움;">) </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;">소지자</span></p></td> 
</tr> 
<tr> <td style="width: 119px; height: 38px; border-width: 1px; border-style: dotted solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle;"> 
<p class="5" style="line-height: 100%; margin-left: 0px; text-align: center; word-break: keep-all; vertical-align: middle;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;">10%</span></p></td> 
<td colspan="2" style="width: 539px; height: 38px; border-width: 1px; border-style: dotted solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle;"> 
<p class="0" style="line-height: 115%;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;">ㅇ 국세청 홈택스 세금포인트 할인쿠폰 소지자</span></p></td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td style="width: 119px; height: 42px; border-width: 1px; border-style: dotted solid solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle;"> 
<p class="5" style="line-height: 100%; margin-left: 0px; text-align: center; word-break: keep-all; vertical-align: middle;"><span style="font-family: 돋움;">연계 할인</span></p></td> 
<td colspan="2" style="width: 539px; height: 42px; border-width: 1px; border-style: dotted solid solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vertical-align: middle;"> 
<p class="0" style="line-height: 115%;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;">ㅇ 기획전시(스투파의 숲, 신비로운 인도 이야기) 관람권 정가 구매자(당일 한정)</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="line-height: 115%;"><span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 돋움;"> </span><span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 돋움;">- </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;">성인 </span><span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 돋움;">2,000</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;">원</span><span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 돋움;">/ </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;">어린이 및 청소년 </span><span style="letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-family: 돋움;">1,000</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: -0.3pt;">원을 할인</span><span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 돋움;"> </span></p></td> 
</tr> 
</tbody> 
</table> 
<p class="0"><span style="font-family: 돋움;"> &nbsp; </span></p> 
<p class="0"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">* </span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">관련 증빙 자료를 반드시 지참해주세요</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">.</span></p> 
<p class="0"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">* </span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">무료나 할인 적용은 관람객에게 유리한 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">1</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">종만 적용됩니다</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">중복 불가</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">).</span></p> 
<p class="0"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">* </span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">온라인 예매의 취소</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;">‧</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">환불은 관람 지정일 기준 전일 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">17</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">시까지 가능하며</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">, </span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">그 이후 및 관람일</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">자 당일에 취소 처리는 티켓 판매처의 취소</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;">‧</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">환불 정책을 따릅니다</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">.</span></p> 
<p class="0"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">* </span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">단체관람은 상황에 따라 가능한 경우 진행하며</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">, 1688-0361</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">로 사전 예약하셔야 합니다</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">.&nbsp;</span></p> 
<p class="0"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">* </span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">현장에서는 당일 티켓만 구매하실 수 있습니다</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">.</span></p> 
<p class="0"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">* </span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">관람 지정 일자가 지난 티켓은 사용할 수 없습니다</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">.</span></p> 
