<p class="0" style="line-height: 160%; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;"><br>○ </span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">대표 전시품</span></p><span style="font-family: 돋움;"> </span> 
<p class="0" style="line-height: 160%; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 돋움;">최득현</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">, </span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">김득신 등</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">, &lt;</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">화성원행도 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">8</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">폭병풍</span>&gt;, 1795<span style="font-family: 돋움;">년</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">, </span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">국립중앙박물관 소장</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">덕수</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">1042)</span></p><span style="font-family: 돋움;"> </span> 
<p class="0" style="line-height: 160%; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 돋움;">작가 모름</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">, &lt;</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">진하도</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">&gt;, 1783</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">년</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">, </span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">국립중앙박물관 소장</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">본관</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">8221)</span></p><span style="font-family: 돋움;"> </span> 
<p class="0" style="line-height: 160%; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 돋움;">김두량</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">, &lt;</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">삽살개</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">&gt;, 1743</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">년</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">, </span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">개인 소장</span></p><span style="font-family: 돋움;"> </span> 
<p class="0" style="line-height: 160%; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 돋움;">정조</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">, &lt;</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">어필</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">&gt;, 1798</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">년</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">, </span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">국립중앙박물관 소장</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">덕수</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">2736), *</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">보물</span></p><span style="font-family: 돋움;"> </span> 
<p class="0" style="line-height: 160%; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 돋움;">진재해 추정</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">, &lt;</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">박문수 분무공신상</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">&gt;, 1728</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">년</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">, </span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">개인 소장</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">천안박물관 보관</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">) *</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">보물</span></p><span style="font-family: 돋움;"> </span> 
<p class="0" style="line-height: 160%; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 돋움;">작가 모름</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">, </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;">《</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">무신친정계첩</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;">》</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">, 1728</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">년</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">, </span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">국립중앙박물관 소장</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">본관</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">7865)</span></p><span style="font-family: 돋움;"> </span> 
<p class="0" style="line-height: 160%; text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: 돋움;">영조</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">, </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;">『</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">어제대훈</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt;">』</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">, 1742</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">년</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">, </span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">국립중앙박물관 소장</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">, 2021</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">년 이건희 기증</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움;">건희</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">8715)</span></p><span style="font-family: 돋움;"> </span> 
