<p class="0" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">◦ </span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">전시품</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;">: </span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">기마인물형뿔잔</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;">(</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">국보 제</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;">275</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">호</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;">) </span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">등 2</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;">,600</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">여 점</span></p> 
