<p class="0" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">◦ </span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">협력</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;">: </span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">국립박물관문화재단</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">◦ </span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">출품기관</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;">: </span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">국립김해박물관 등 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 12pt;">31</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">개 기관<br>
