<p class="0" style="font-size: 14pt;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;">2. </span><span style="font-size: 14pt;">공존을 지킨 힘</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;">-</span><span style="font-size: 14pt;">가야무사</span></p> 
