<p class="0" style="line-height: 180%;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">ㅇ </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">기간&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">: </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">2021. 7. 21.(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">수</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">) ~ 2021. 9. 26.(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">일</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">) <strong><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">※ 추석 당일(9. 21.) 휴</span><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">관</span></strong><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></span></p> 
<p class="0" style="line-height: 180%;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">ㅇ </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">장소&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">: </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">국립중앙박물관 상설전시관 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">2</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">층 서화</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">Ⅱ</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;">실</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;"> <span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></span></p> 
