<p class="1" style="line-height: 200%;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;"><br> 2021</span><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">년 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">4</span><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">월</span></p> 
<p class="1" style="line-height: 180%;"><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">고</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">故 </span><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">이건희 회장의 문화유산 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">2</span><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">만 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">천 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">백여 점이</span></p> 
<p class="1" style="line-height: 180%;"><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">국립중앙박물관에 기증되었습니다</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">.</span></p> 
<p class="1" style="line-height: 180%;"><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;"> </span></p> 
<p class="1" style="line-height: 180%;"><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">선사시대부터 조선시대에 이르는</span></p> 
<p class="1" style="line-height: 180%;"><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">토기</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">도자기</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">금속기</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">조각</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">서화</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">목가구로 </span></p> 
<p class="1" style="line-height: 180%;"><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">이루어진 방대한 기증품은 </span></p> 
<p class="1" style="line-height: 180%;"><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">당대 최고의 기술과 디자인을 보여주는</span></p> 
<p class="1" style="line-height: 180%;"><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">명품입니다</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">. <br>
 <br></span></p> 
<p class="1" style="line-height: 180%;"><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;"> </span></p> 
<p class="1" style="line-height: 180%;"><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">삼성 신 경영</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">디자인 경영</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">마하 경영</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">.</span></p> 
<p class="1" style="line-height: 180%;"><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">기술 혁신과 함께 디자인을 중시했던 </span></p> 
<p class="1" style="line-height: 180%;"><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">이건희 회장의 경영 철학이 떠오릅니다</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">.<br>
 <br></span></p> 
<p class="1" style="line-height: 180%;"><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;"> </span></p> 
<p class="1" style="line-height: 180%;"><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">이건희 회장이 누구보다 더 치열하게 고민하고</span></p> 
<p class="1" style="line-height: 180%;"><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">문화 강국을 위한 사명감으로 </span></p> 
<p class="1" style="line-height: 180%;"><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">한 점 한 점 모은 위대한 문화유산을 감상하시면서</span></p> 
<p class="1" style="line-height: 180%;"><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">명품을 만든 선인의 노력과</span></p> 
<p class="1" style="line-height: 180%;"><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">명품을 지켜온 기증자의 철학을</span></p> 
<p class="1" style="line-height: 180%;"><span style="font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">생각해 보는 기회가 되었으면 합니다</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 바탕; font-size: 11pt;">. </span></p> 
