 <span style="font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 700;">&nbsp; [영문 리플릿 다운로드]&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><a href="/site/main/filedown/73oRBMJ1x9rkExOcWSbGDQ=="><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline;">인쇄용</span></a><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 700;">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span> <a href="/site/main/filedown/mtwC1-9QhJ_mRHt92ZGBHA=="><span style="font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: underline;">모바일용</span></a><br>
 <span style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; text-indent: -31.7pt;"><br></span><span style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;">□ 관람료 및 입장권 할인</span></p> 
