 <span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: NanumGothic, &quot;MS PGothic&quot;, Dotum, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">제3</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&middot;4</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">폭</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">「효정왕후를 위한 연회가 열리다</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style="font-family: 함초롬바탕; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: 돋움;">慶運堂 內進饌圖</span></span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-weight: bold; font-family: 돋움;">」</span></span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt;">&nbsp;</span></p> 
