<p class="0" style="line-height: 150%;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 16px;"><br></span><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; font-family: 돋움;"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: NanumGothic, &quot;MS PGothic&quot;, Dotum, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">제5</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&middot;6</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">폭</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">「늦은 밤 연회가 열리다</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: 돋움;">慶運堂 夜進饌圖</span></span><span style="font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-weight: bold;">」</span></span><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 12pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움;">&nbsp;<br></span><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 16px;">1901년 5월 13일 밤, 경운궁&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 16px;">경운당<br>
 <br></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; font-family: 돋움;"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: NanumGothic, &quot;MS PGothic&quot;, Dotum, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">제7</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&middot;8</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">폭</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">「고종 황제가 연회를 베풀다</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: 돋움;">慶運堂 翌日 會酌圖</span></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-weight: bold;">」</span></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움;">&nbsp;<br></span><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 16px;">1901년 5월 16일 아침, 경운궁&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 16px;">경운당<br>
 <br></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 12pt; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none; font-family: 돋움;"><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: NanumGothic, &quot;MS PGothic&quot;, Dotum, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">제9</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">폭</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 돋움; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;">「황태자가 연회를 베풀다</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp;</span></span></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt;"><span style="font-family: 돋움;">慶運堂 在翌日 會酌圖</span></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-weight: bold;">」</span></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움;">&nbsp;<br></span><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 16px;">1901년 5월 18일 아침, 경운궁&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 16px;">경운당<br>
