<p style="line-height: 140%;"><br>
 <span style="font-size: 16px; text-indent: -24.4px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">※&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 16px; text-indent: -24.4px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">쾌적한 관람 환경 조성을 위해 30분 단위 회차별 입장인원을 제한하고 있으므로,&nbsp;무료 대상자도 무료 입장권을 예약(인터파크, 티켓링크), 발권해야 합니다.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br>
<span style="color: rgb(63, 63, 63);"> </span><span style="color: rgb(63, 63, 63);"> </span></p><span style="color: rgb(63, 63, 63);"> </span>
<p class="0" style="text-indent: -18.3pt; margin-left: 24px; line-height: 140%;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">※ </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">무료</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">, </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">할인대상자는 관련 증빙</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">(</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">가족관계증명서</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">, </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">신분증</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">,&nbsp;</span><span style="text-indent: -18.3pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">국가보훈신분증</span><span lang="EN-US" style="text-indent: -18.3pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">(</span><span style="text-indent: -18.3pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">국가보훈등록증</span><span lang="EN-US" style="text-indent: -18.3pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">)</span><span style="text-indent: -18.3pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);"><span style="color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">.</span> 그 외 증빙서류 등</span><span style="text-indent: -18.3pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">)</span><span style="text-indent: -18.3pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">을 현장 매표소에 제시하여야 하며</span><span style="text-indent: -18.3pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">,&nbsp;</span><span style="text-indent: -18.3pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">증빙이 안 될 경우 현장에서 차액을 지불해야 합니다</span><span style="text-indent: -18.3pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">.</span></p><span style="color: rgb(63, 63, 63);"> </span>
<p class="0" style="text-indent: -18.3pt; margin-left: 24px; line-height: 140%;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">※ </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">유아</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">(</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">만</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">4</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">세</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">~6</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">세</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">)</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">는 이미 할인된 가격이므로</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">, </span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">중복할인하지 않습니다</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">(문화가 있는 날은 제외).</span></p><span style="color: rgb(63, 63, 63);"> </span>
<p class="0" style="text-indent: -18.3pt; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 24px; line-height: 140%;"><span style="text-indent: -24.4px; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">※&nbsp;</span><span style="text-indent: -33.3pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">온라인 예매 입장권의 취소</span><span style="text-indent: -33.3pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">,&nbsp;</span><span style="text-indent: -33.3pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">환불은 관람 지정일 기준 전일 오후 5시</span><span style="text-indent: -33.3pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">까지 가능하며(수수료는 입장권 예매처마다 다름),&nbsp;당일의 취소,</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -33.3pt; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);"><span style="color: rgb(63, 63, 63);">환불처리는 입장권 예매처에 문의바랍니다</span>.</span><span style="text-indent: -24.4px;"><br></span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 140%;"><br></p> 
<p class="0" style="margin-left: 44px; text-indent: -33.3pt; line-height: 140%;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt;"></span></p> 
<p style="line-height: 140%;"><br></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-indent: -18.3pt; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 24px; line-height: 140%;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br> </span></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-indent: -18.3pt; margin-left: 24px;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">❏ </span><span style="font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">관람 안내</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-indent: -31.7pt; margin-left: 42px;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;"> </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;"> </span><span style="font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">관람 시간</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-indent: -31.7pt; margin-left: 42px;"><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;"> </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">- 30</span><span style="font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">분 단위의 회차별로 입장합니다</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;">.</span></p> 
