<p class="0"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 3pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);">&nbsp;</span></p> 
<p class="0"><span style="font-family: 맑은; letter-spacing: 0pt;">※&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: 맑은;">무료</span><span style="font-family: 맑은; letter-spacing: 0pt;">,&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: 맑은;">할인대상자는</span><span style="font-family: 맑은; letter-spacing: 0pt;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: 맑은;">관련 증빙 지참 필수</span><span style="font-family: 맑은; letter-spacing: 0pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 맑은;">가족관계증명서</span><span style="font-family: 맑은; letter-spacing: 0pt;">,&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: 맑은;">신분증</span><span style="font-family: 맑은; letter-spacing: 0pt;">,&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: 맑은;">그 외 증빙서류 등</span><span style="font-family: 맑은; letter-spacing: 0pt;">)</span></p> 
<p class="0"><span style="font-family: 맑은; letter-spacing: 0pt;">※&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: 맑은;">증빙서류 미지참시</span><span style="font-family: 맑은; letter-spacing: 0pt;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: 맑은;">현장에서 차액 지불</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="margin-left: 60px; text-indent: -45pt;"><br> </p> 
<p class="0" style="margin-left: 51px; text-indent: -38.8pt;"><span style="font-family: 맑은; letter-spacing: 0pt;">□ </span><span style="font-family: 맑은;">특별전 연계 학술&nbsp;강연회</span><span style="font-family: 맑은; letter-spacing: 0pt;">: 2024.9.6.(</span><span style="font-family: 맑은;">금</span><span style="font-family: 맑은; letter-spacing: 0pt;">) 14~17시, 국립중앙박물관 소강당(교육동 1층)<br>
 <br></span></p> 
