<p class="0" style="text-align: left; line-height: 120%; text-indent: -27pt; margin-left: 36px;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt;">ㅇ「</span><span>장애인복지법</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt;">」</span><span>에 따라 등록된 장애인과 그 동반 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt;">1</span><span>인</span></p> 
