<p class="0" style="text-align: center; line-height: 200%;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 173, 254); font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">국립중앙박물관 </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 173, 254); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">2021</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 173, 254); font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">년 괘불전</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="text-align: center; line-height: 200%;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 173, 254); font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;">빛을 펼치다</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 173, 254); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;">&ndash;</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 173, 254); font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;">국보 제</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 173, 254); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;">299</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 173, 254); font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;">호 공주 신원사 괘불<br>
 <br>
