<p class="0" style="text-indent: 10pt; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;<span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 9pt;">※ </span><span style="font-size: 9pt;">국가보훈대상자 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 9pt;">: </span><span style="font-size: 9pt;">애국지사</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 9pt;">, </span><span style="font-size: 9pt;">국가유공자</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 9pt;">, 5.18</span><span style="font-size: 9pt;">민주유공자</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 9pt;">, </span><span style="font-size: 9pt;">특수임무공로자 및 그 배우자</span></p> 
