<p align="center" style="font-size: 14px"><strong><font color="#00008b"><font size="3">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font><br />
<font color="#000000">국립중앙박물관<br />
<font color="#00008b">역사관 테마전시 &quot;한글 노래의 풍류(風流) - 시조(時調)&middot;가사(歌辭)&quot;</font></font></font></strong></p>

<p align="center" style="font-size: 14px">&nbsp;</p>

<table border="1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" height="215" style="border-top: medium none; border-right: medium none; border-collapse: collapse; border-bottom: medium none; border-left: medium none" width="469">
 <tbody>
  <tr>
   <td height="215" style="border-top: #939393 0.12mm solid; border-right: #939393 0.12mm solid; border-bottom: #939393 0.12mm solid; border-left: #939393 0.12mm solid" valign="middle" width="467">
   <p align="left" style="font-size: 12px; font-family: '돋움'; color: #5d5d5d; margin: 0px; line-height: 16px; text-indent: 0px"><span style="font-size: 12px; font-family: '돋움'; color: #5d5d5d; line-height: 16px"><span style="font-size: 12px; font-family: '돋움'; color: #5d5d5d; line-height: 16px">&nbsp;&nbsp; ㅇ장&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 소 : 국립중앙박물관 역사관 한글실 입구&nbsp;<br />
   &nbsp;&nbsp; ㅇ전시&nbsp; 기간 : 2008년 10월 7일(화) ～ 12월 28일(일)<br />
   &nbsp;&nbsp; ㅇ전&nbsp; 시&nbsp; 품 : 19건 29점<br />
   &nbsp;&nbsp; ㅇ전시설명회 : 2008.10.7(화) 16:30~17:00 - 진행(학예연구관 조원교)<br />
   &nbsp;&nbsp; ㅇ초청강연회 : 2008.10.23(목) 16:00~18:00<br />
   &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 강연 제목: &lsquo;한국의 전통악기-시조&middot;가사의 연주와 관련하여&rsquo;<br />
   &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 강사 : 국립국악원 학예연구사 이정엽&nbsp;<br />
   &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 장소 : 본관 교육동(1층) 제2강의실<br />
   &nbsp;&nbsp; ㅇ큐레이터와의 대화 : 2008.10.15(수) 19:30~20:00&nbsp;<br />
   &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 전시된 가사&middot;시조의 설명(학예연구관 조원교)<br />
   &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2008.12.17(수) 18:30~19:00&nbsp;<br />
   &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 전시된 가사&middot;시조의 설명(학예연구사 김효경)</span></span></p>
