<p class="0" style="line-height: 160%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;"><strong>&nbsp;전시기간</strong></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;"><strong>:</strong> 2016.11.29.(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">화</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">)~2017.1.30.(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">월</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">)</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="line-height: 160%; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;"><strong>&nbsp;전시장소</strong></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;"><strong>:</strong> </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">국립중앙박물관 특별전시실</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="line-height: 160%; text-indent: -58pt; font-size: 12pt; margin-left: 77px;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;"><strong>&nbsp;전 시 품</strong></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;"><strong>:</strong> </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">공산성 출토 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">&lsquo;</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">貞觀十九年</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">&rsquo;</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">명 옻칠갑옷편</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">왕흥사지</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">‧</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">미륵사지</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">‧</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">왕궁리 출토 사리장엄</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">왕흥사 승방지 <br>출토 치미</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">, </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">무령왕 지석 및 왕</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">‧</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">왕비 관식 등 웅진</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">‧</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">사비기 대표 문화재 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">350</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">건 </span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">1,700</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">여점</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="line-height: 160%; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;"><strong>&nbsp;주     최</strong></span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;"><strong>:</strong> </span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">국립중앙박물관</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">‧</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">(</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">재</span><span style="letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">)</span><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">백제세계유산센터</span></p> 
<p class="0" style="line-height: 160%; font-size: 12pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;특별 협력</span>:</strong><span> <span style="font-size: 11pt;">국립부여문화재연구소</span></span><br></p></td> 
