⠀

k-arts space opening exhibition   

k-arts space (formerly gallery 175) marks a new chapter with its relocation to seokgwan-dong, inaugurating the exhibition   . featuring works by kyulim kim and aram lee, the exhibition explores global physical movements and cultural displacements, the history and memory of sites and places shaped by institutional and systemic frameworks, and the interplay between their material and immaterial dimensions.

