<embed src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/XjhWGPlvp3o" type="text/html" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture;"></div></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>$str$,
