lack .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .25pt;"><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong><u>24</u></strong></span></p><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong><p align="left" style="text-align: left;"><br></p></strong></span><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>17:00</strong> ⑮ⓀⒺ</span><br><span style="font-size: 12pt;">우리를 갈라놓는 것들 </span><br><span style="color: rgb(255, 108, 0); font-size: 12pt;">스크리닝 & 토크 </span></p><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><br></p><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><br></p><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 108, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0px 0px 1pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) black; padding: 1.4pt 5.1pt; border-image: none; height: 107.4pt; background-color: transparent; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .25pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: solid black .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .25pt;"><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong><u>25</u></strong></span></p><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong><p align="left" style="text-align: left;"><br></p></strong></span><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>15:00</strong> ⑫ⓀⒺ</span><br><span style="font-size: 12pt;">교환일기 (61min)</span></p><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><br></p><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><br></p><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><br></p><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 112.6pt; mso-yfti-irow: 2; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes;"><td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 2.25pt 0px; border-style: none solid double none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) black black rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 1.4pt 5.1pt; height: 112.6pt; background-color: transparent; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .25pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: double black 2.25pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid black .25pt;"><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong><u>28 </u></strong></span></p><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong><p align="left" style="text-align: left;"><br></p></strong></span><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>15:00</strong> ⑮ⓀⒺ</span><br><span style="font-size: 12pt;">위로공단 (<span style="font-size: 12pt;">95min)</span></span></p><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></p><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></p><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><br></p><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0px 1pt 2.25pt 0px; border-style: none solid double none; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) black black rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 1.4pt 5.1pt; height: 112.6pt; background-color: transparent; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .25pt; mso-border-bottom-alt: double black 2.25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .25pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .25pt;"><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong><u>29</u></strong></span></p><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong><p align="left" style="text-align: left;"><br></p></strong></span><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>15:00</strong> ⑫ⓀⒺ</span><br><span style="font-size: 12pt;">단편 프로그램 3 </span><br><span style="font-size: