ng></span><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>15:00</strong> ⑮ⓀⒺ</span><br><span style="font-size: 12pt;">비념 (93min)</span><br><span style="color: rgb(255, 108, 0); font-size: 12pt;">스크리닝 & 토크</span></p><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><br></p><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><br></p><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><span style="color: rgb(255, 108, 0); font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></p></td><td style="border-width: 0px 0px 2.25pt; border-style: none none double; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0) rgb(0, 0, 0) black; padding: 1.4pt 5.1pt; border-image: none; height: 112.6pt; background-color: transparent; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .25pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .25pt;"><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong><u>4.1</u></strong></span></p><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong><p align="left" style="text-align: left;"><br></p></strong></span><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><strong>15:00</strong> ⑮ⓀⒺ</span><br><span style="font-size: 12pt;">우리를 갈라놓는 것들 </span><br><span style="font-size: 12pt;">(108min) </span></p><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></p><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><br></p><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="line-height: 1.8;"><font face="굴림" size="3">

