</p><p align="left" style="line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">﻿</span><br></p><p style="line-height: 1.8;"><b><span style=" font-size: 12pt;">■ 억압된 것들의 귀환</span></b><br>
</p><p align="left" style="line-height: 1.8;"><img alt="억압된 것들의 귀환" src="http://www.mmca.go.kr/upload/m/data/exhibition/2010/11/pop3.jpg"><br>
</p><p align="left" style="line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">﻿</span><br></p><p style="line-height: 1.8;"><b><span style=" font-size: 12pt;">■ 타인의 고통</span></b><br>
</p><p align="left" style="line-height: 1.8;"><img alt="타인의 고통" src="http://www.mmca.go.kr/upload/m/data/exhibition/2010/11/pop4.jpg"><span style=" font-size: 12pt;"> </span></p></div>$str$,
