<td style="border-width: 0px 0px 1px 1px; border-style: none none solid solid; border-color: currentColor currentColor rgb(255, 255, 255) rgb(255, 255, 255); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 12pt;">​</span></p><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 10pt;"><strong><span style="font-size: 10pt;">예사로운 동굴</span></strong>&nbsp; </span><br><span style="font-size: 10pt;">중국 | 2017 | 47분 53초 </span></p><p align="left" style="text-align: left; line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 9pt;">5월 24일(목)&nbsp; 13:00 – 17:30 (루프)&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><br><span style="font-size: 9pt;">5월 25일(금)&nbsp; 15:30 | 19:00 </span><br><span style="font-size: 9pt;">5월 26일(토)&nbsp; 15:00 (*프로그램 1+2)</span></p></td>
