</font></p><p align="left" style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; text-align: left; line-height: 1.8; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 나눔고딕; font-size: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;"><font size="2">&nbsp;</font></span><span style="font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 굴림; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;"><font size="2"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">이번 전시는 전시실</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12pt;"> 6, 7, </span></font><font size="2"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">미디어랩을 관람 동선의 축으로 놓고 전시장 바깥의 비워진 공간들</span></font><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2">, </font></span><font size="2"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">외부와
