<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; line-height: 1.8;" class="MsoNormal"><span style='mso-ascii-font-family: "맑은 고딕"; mso-hansi-font-family: "맑은 고딕"; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt;'><font size="2" face="맑은 고딕">일 정<span lang="EN-US">: 8</span>월<span lang="EN-US"> 15</span>일<span lang="EN-US"> (</span>금<span lang="EN-US">) 10</span>시<span lang="EN-US"> - 21</span>시<span lang="EN-US">, 8</span>월<span lang="EN-US"> 16</span>일<span lang="EN-US"> (</span>토<span lang="EN-US">) 10</span>시<span lang="EN-US"> - 21</span>시</font><span lang="EN-US"><br></span><font size="2"><font face="맑은 고딕">장 소<span lang="EN-US">: </span>국립현대미술관 서울관 여러 공간<span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; line-height: 1.8;" class="MsoNormal"><span style='mso-ascii-font-family: "맑은 고딕"; mso-hansi-font-family: "맑은 고딕"; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt;' lang="EN-US"><o:p><font size="2" face="맑은 고딕">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; line-height: 1.8;" class="MsoNormal"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;"><span style='mso-ascii-font-family: "맑은 고딕"; mso-hansi-font-family: "맑은 고딕"; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt;'><font size="2"><font face="맑은 고딕">출연 및 구성<span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></span></b></p>
<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; line-height: 1.8;" class="MsoNormal"><span style='mso-ascii-font-family: "맑은 고딕"; mso-hansi-font-family: "맑은 고딕"; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt;'><font size="2"><font face="맑은 고딕">기 획<span lang="EN-US">: </span>방혜진<span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></font></font></span></p>
