<p style="line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-family: " 맑은="" 고딕";="" font-size:="" 10pt;="" mso-ascii-theme-font:="" minor-fareast;="" mso-hansi-theme-font:="" mso-font-kerning:="" 0pt;="" mso-bidi-font-family:="" "times="" new="" roman";="" mso-bidi-font-size:="" 11.0pt;="" mso-fareast-theme-font:="" mso-bidi-theme-font:="" minor-bidi;="" mso-ansi-language:="" en-us;="" mso-fareast-language:="" ko;="" mso-bidi-language:="" ar-sa;"=""><span lang="EN-US"><span style="font-family: " 맑은="" 고딕";="" font-size:="" 10pt;="" mso-ascii-theme-font:="" minor-fareast;="" mso-hansi-theme-font:="" mso-font-kerning:="" 0pt;="" mso-bidi-font-family:="" "times="" new="" roman";="" mso-bidi-font-size:="" 11.0pt;="" mso-fareast-theme-font:="" mso-bidi-theme-font:="" minor-bidi;="" mso-ansi-language:="" en-us;="" mso-fareast-language:="" ko;="" mso-bidi-language:="" ar-sa;"="">참여작가<span lang="EN-US">: </span>가이 셔윈<span lang="EN-US">, </span>린 루<span lang="EN-US">, </span>그렉 폽<span lang="EN-US">, </span>타쿠 스기모토<span lang="EN-US">, </span>다케시 이케다<span lang="EN-US">, </span>모에 카무라<span lang="EN-US">, </span>라이오넬 파룬<span lang="EN-US">, </span>에티엔 카이에<span lang="EN-US">, </span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-family: " 맑은="" 고딕";="" font-size:="" 10pt;="" mso-ascii-theme-font:="" minor-fareast;="" mso-hansi-theme-font:="" mso-font-kerning:="" 0pt;="" mso-bidi-font-family:="" "times="" new="" roman";="" mso-bidi-font-size:="" 11.0pt;="" mso-fareast-theme-font:="" mso-bidi-theme-font:="" minor-bidi;="" mso-ansi-language:="" en-us;="" mso-fareast-language:="" ko;="" mso-bidi-language:="" ar-sa;"=""><span lang="EN-US"><span style="font-family: " 맑은="" 고딕";="" font-size:="" 10pt;="" mso-ascii-theme-font:="" minor-fareast;="" mso-hansi-theme-font:="" mso-font-kerning:="" 0pt;="" mso-bidi-font-family:="" "times="" new="" roman";="" mso-bidi-font-size:="" 11.0pt;="" mso-fareast-theme-font:="" mso-bidi-theme-font:="" minor-bidi;="" mso-ansi-language:="" en-us;="" mso-fareast-language:="" ko;="" mso-bidi-language:="" ar-sa;"=""><span lang="EN-US">            Saritote(다케시 이케다 모에 카무라 타쿠 스기모토),</span></span></span></span><span style="font-family: " 맑은="" 고딕";="" font-size:="" 10pt;="" mso-ascii-theme-font:="" minor-fareast;="" mso-hansi-theme-font:="" mso-font-kerning:="" 0pt;="" mso-bidi-font-family:="" "times="" new="" roman";="" mso-bidi-font-size:="" 11.0pt;="" mso-fareast-theme-font:="" mso-bidi-theme-font:="" minor-bidi;="" mso-ansi-language:="" en-us;="" mso-fareast-language:="" ko;="" mso-bidi-language:="" ar-sa;"=""><span lang="EN-US"><span style="font-family: " 맑은="" 고딕";="" font-size:="" 10pt;="" mso-ascii-theme-font:="" minor-fareast;="" mso-hansi-theme-font:="" mso-font-kerning:="" 0pt;="" mso-bidi-font-family:="" "times="" new="" roman";="" mso-bidi-font-size:="" 11.0pt;="" mso-fareast-theme-font:="" mso-bidi-theme-font:="" minor-bidi;="" mso-ansi-language:="" en-us;="" mso-fareast-language:="" ko;="" mso-bidi-language:="" ar-sa;"=""><span lang="EN-US"> </span>마티야 슐렌더<span lang="EN-US">, </span>최준용<span lang="EN-US">, </span>스클라벤탄츠<span lang="EN-US">(</span>최정훈<span lang="EN-US">&</span>조용훈<span lang="EN-US">), </span></span></span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-family: " 맑은="" 고딕";="" font-size:="" 10pt;="" mso-ascii-theme-font:="" minor-fareast;="" mso-hansi-theme-font:="" mso-font-kerning:="" 0pt;="" mso-bidi-font-family:="" "times="" new="" roman";="" mso-bidi-font-size:="" 11.0pt;="" mso-fareast-theme-font:="" mso-bidi-theme-font:="" minor-bidi;="" mso-ansi-language:="" en-us;="" mso-fareast-language:="" ko;="" mso-bidi-language:="" ar-sa;"=""><span lang="EN-US"><span style="font-family: " 맑은="" 고딕";="" font-size:="" 10pt;="" mso-ascii-theme-font:="" minor-fareast;="" mso-hansi-theme-font:="" mso-font-kerning:="" 0pt;="" mso-bidi-font-family:="" "times="" new="" roman";="" mso-bidi-font-size:="" 11.0pt;="" mso-fareast-theme-font:="" mso-bidi-theme-font:="" minor-bidi;="" mso-ansi-language:="" en-us;="" mso-fareast-language:="" ko;="" mso-bidi-language:="" ar-sa;"=""><span lang="EN-US"></span>            사비에 퀘렐<span lang="EN-US">, </span>제롬 노팅거<span lang="EN-US">, </span>그리스토프 어거<span lang="EN-US">, </span></span></span></span><span style="font-family: " 맑은="" 고딕";="" font-size:="" 10pt;="" mso-ascii-theme-font:="" minor-fareast;="" mso-hansi-theme-font:="" mso-font-kerning:="" 0pt;="" mso-bidi-font-family:="" "times="" new="" roman";="" mso-bidi-font-size:="" 11.0pt;="" mso-fareast-theme-font:="" mso-bidi-theme-font:="" minor-bidi;="" mso-ansi-language:="" en-us;="" mso-fareast-language:="" ko;="" mso-bidi-language:="" ar-sa;"=""><span lang="EN-US"><span style="font-family: " 맑은="" 고딕";="" font-size:="" 10pt;="" mso-ascii-theme-font:="" minor-fareast;="" mso-hansi-theme-font:="" mso-font-kerning:="" 0pt;="" mso-bidi-font-family:="" "times="" new="" roman";="" mso-bidi-font-size:="" 11.0pt;="" mso-fareast-theme-font:="" mso-bidi-theme-font:="" minor-bidi;="" mso-ansi-language:="" en-us;="" mso-fareast-language:="" ko;="" mso-bidi-language:="" ar-sa;"="">앤소니 맥콜<span lang="EN-US">, </span>케빈 드럼<span lang="EN-US">, </span>위르겐 레블<span lang="EN-US">, </span>토마스 코너<span lang="EN-US">, </span></span></span></span></p>
