<p style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; line-height: 1.8;" class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-family: " 맑은="" 고딕";="" font-size:="" 10pt;="" mso-ascii-theme-font:="" minor-fareast;="" mso-hansi-theme-font:="" mso-bidi-font-family:="" "times="" new="" roman";="" mso-bidi-font-size:="" 11.0pt;="" mso-fareast-theme-font:="" mso-bidi-theme-font:="" minor-bidi;="" mso-ansi-language:="" en-us;="" mso-fareast-language:="" ko;="" mso-bidi-language:="" ar-sa;"="" lang="EN-US">- </span><span style="font-family: " 맑은="" 고딕";="" font-size:="" 10pt;="" mso-ascii-theme-font:="" minor-fareast;="" mso-hansi-theme-font:="" mso-bidi-font-family:="" "times="" new="" roman";="" mso-bidi-font-size:="" 11.0pt;="" mso-fareast-theme-font:="" mso-bidi-theme-font:="" minor-bidi;="" mso-ansi-language:="" en-us;="" mso-fareast-language:="" ko;="" mso-bidi-language:="" ar-sa;"="">가이 셔윈<span lang="EN-US">(</span>영국<span lang="EN-US">), </span>사비에 퀘렐<span lang="EN-US">(</span>프랑스<span lang="EN-US">), </span>류한길<span lang="EN-US">(</span>한국<span lang="EN-US">)</span></span></p>
