<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNoSpacing><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=2 face="맑은 고딕">&nbsp;</FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNoSpacing align=left><FONT size=2><FONT face="맑은 고딕"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt" lang=EN-US>&lt;</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt">전시 연계 프로그램<SPAN lang=EN-US>&gt;<o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></FONT></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNoSpacing align=left><FONT size=2><FONT face="맑은 고딕"><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt" lang=EN-US>1. </SPAN><SPAN style="mso-ascii-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: '맑은 고딕'; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt">학술 세미나 <SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
