<p style="line-height: 1.8;"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family: "맑은 고딕"; font-size: 11pt; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;'>3. </span><span style='font-family: "맑은 고딕"; font-size: 11pt; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;'>균열<span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 11pt;"> 76-421_1976_Acrylic and mixed media on linen_129.8x96.5cm_Courtesy of the artist</span></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.8;"><span style='font-family: "맑은 고딕"; font-size: 9pt; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;'><span lang="EN-US"></span></span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p><span style='font-family: "맑은 고딕"; font-size: 9pt; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;'><span lang="EN-US">
<p class="MsoNoSpacing" style="margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; line-height: 1.8;"><font size="2"><strong><span lang="EN-US" style='font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-ascii-font-family: "맑은 고딕"; mso-hansi-font-family: "맑은 고딕"; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;'>1980</span><span style='font-size: 12pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-ascii-font-family: "맑은 고딕"; mso-hansi-font-family: "맑은 고딕"; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; mso-font-kerning: 0pt;'>년대<span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></span></strong></font></p>
<p style="line-height: 1.8;"><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family: "맑은 고딕"; font-size: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;'>&nbsp;1980</span><span style='font-family: "맑은 고딕"; font-size: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;'>년대 작가는<span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12pt;"> &lt;</span>얼레짓<span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12pt;">&gt; </span>연작을 발표하였다<span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12pt;">. </span>‘얼레짓’은 연실을 감는 ‘얼레’와 ‘얼레빗’ 그리고 행위 명사 ‘짓’을 합성한 단어이다<span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12pt;">. &lt;</span>얼레짓<span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12pt;">&gt; </span>연작은<span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12pt;"> 70</span>년대<span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12pt;"> &lt;</span>균열<span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12pt;">&gt; </span>연작에서 강조되던 물질적인 현상의 우연성과 대비되는 신체의 반복에 의한 적극적인 표현이 돋보이는 작업이다<span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12pt;">. </span>작가는 아크릴 물감과 먹을 이용하여 촘촘한 빗질 같은 선으로 면을 구축하듯 쌓아올리며 전면적인 화면을 구성한다<span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12pt;">. </span>반복적인 붓질은 여러 겹의 층을 형성하며<span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12pt;">, </span>꽉 짜인 그물망 같이 얽히고설킨 단단한 표면을 구축한다<span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12pt;">. 80</span>년대 중반 이후의<span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12pt;"> &lt;</span>얼레짓<span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12pt;">&gt; </span>연작은 마치 한 폭의 문인화<span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12pt;">(</span></span><span style='font-family: "바탕","serif"; font-size: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-ascii-font-family: "맑은 고딕"; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;'>文人畵</span><span lang="EN-US" style='font-family: "맑은 고딕"; font-size: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;'>)</span><span style='font-family: "맑은 고딕"; font-size: 12pt; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;'>를 연상시키는 듯한 비워진 공간의 구성과 무심한 듯 경쾌하게 흘러내리는 자유로운 선의 흐름을 통해 새로운 변화의 기운을 보여준다<span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 12pt;">.</span></span></p>
<p><span style='font-family: "맑은 고딕"; font-size: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;'><span lang="EN-US"><img alt="윤명로: 정신의 흔적 작품3" src="http://www.mmca.go.kr/upload/m/data/editorUpload/2013/03/26/20130326083204.png"></span></span></p><span style='font-family: "맑은 고딕"; font-size: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-font-kerning: 0pt; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-fareast-language: KO; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;'><span lang="EN-US">
