  $str$<p style="line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">`91 신소장품전Ⅱ</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">1부(양화, 공예, 판화, 사진)</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">* 기간: 1992. 6.12. ~ 7.1.</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.8;"><font size="3">* 작품수: 총 33점(양화 28점, 공예 3점, 사진 2점)</font></p><p style="line-height: 1.8;"><font size="3">* 작가:&nbsp;<font size="3"><span style="font-size: 11pt;">&lt;양화&gt;&nbsp;&nbsp;윤동구, 김진수, 권여현, 오치균, 김세영, 박재영, 정충일, 김형대, 조택호, 최 명영, 윤형근, 한영섭, 김수자&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></font></p><p style="line-height: 1.8;"><font size="3"><span style="font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &lt;판화&gt;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><font size="3"><span style="font-size: 11pt;">게르하르트 리터와 씨그마폴케, 브레머, 브라이언 헌트, 스페라키스, 오광섭, 윤명로</span></font></font></p><p style="line-height: 1.8;"><font size="3"><font size="3"><span style="font-size: 11pt;"><font size="3"><span style="font-size: 11pt;"><font size="3"><span style="font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &lt;공예&gt;&nbsp;&nbsp; 정경연, 박애정, 서도식</span></font></span></font></span></font></font></p><p style="line-height: 1.8;"><font size="3"><span style="font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &lt;사진&gt;&nbsp; 데이비드 호크니, 최병관</span></font><p style="line-height: 1.8;"><br></p><p></p><p style="line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">2부(한국화, 조각, 드로잉)</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">* 기간: 1992. 7. 7. ~ 7.26</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.8;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">* 작품수: 총 26점(한국화 9점, 조각 13점, 건축(드로잉) 4점)</span></p><p style="line-height: 1.8;"><font size="3">* 작가: <span style="font-size: 11pt;">&lt;한국화&gt; 이경수, 김호득, 오낭자, 이선우, 김태신, 김수길, 정은영, 김흥종, 김근중<font size="3"><span style="font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></font></span></font></p><p style="line-height: 1.8;"><font size="3"><span style="font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &lt;비디오&gt;&nbsp;박현기, 하동철&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style="line-height: 1.8;"><font size="3"><span style="font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &lt;조각&gt;&nbsp; 주해준, 김창희, 박충흠, 김효숙, 원인종, 김청정, 오종욱, 신옥주, 전국광, 조 성묵, 김희성</span></font><p style="line-height: 1.8;"><font size="3"><font size="3"><span style="font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &lt;건축&gt;&nbsp; 김수근</span></font></font></p><p></p>$str$,
