※매표소 안내당일 현장매표 : 예술의전당 비타민스테이션 내 예매,단체,이벤트 : 한가람미술관 1층 안내데스크 옆


When the Pyramid is opened, the ancient mythology is alive!!The Louvre Museum returns for a second time following the exhibition held in Korea in 2006. 
Wrath of the Titans, Clash of the Titans, Troy and Percy Jackson &amp; The Olympians: The Lightning Thief...
These are movies based on Greek mythology: stories about gods and heroes, the nature of the world, and the origins of cult and ritual practices from ancient Greeks. Featuring collections from Louvre Museum related to the stories of the recently released film Wrath of the Titans, the prequel of Titan series Clash of the Titans, and Troy, starring Brad Pitt as the Greek hero Achilles. The blockbuster exhibition entitled `Myths and Legends` will last at Seoul Arts Center until September 30.<!-- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   (in Korean)
   
   








